  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help fund a porridge kitchen for children in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing food prices and climate change have caused a spike in malnutrition among vulnerable children in Kakamega County, Kenya. Children not yet in school are unable to benefit from free school meals and often go without a meal. The Nasio Trust&apos;s porridge kitchen would ensure that children do not go hungry and lead healthy lives.</narrative>
  </description>
